;
; How Quarry files one held citation, in MYRA (quarry_rules.h QR3): its
; number (4 digits), the topic it was found under (3), its kind (1 a Hoard
; file, 2 a Web4 envelope), when its source was written in seconds since
; 1970 (12 digits) and the bytes of its excerpt (5). Quarry asks whether
; the numbers fit before it holds a citation.
^ZXQUARRY(cite:i4) = topic:i3! ^ kind:i1! ^ stamp:i12! ^ quote:i5!
